---
const highlights = [
  { value: "3+", label: "Years Experience" },
  { value: "17+", label: "Projects Delivered" },
  { value: "20+", label: "Technologies" },
];
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="section-container">
    <span class="section-label">01 — About</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading">About Me</h2>
    <p class="section-subheading">A bit about my background and what drives me.</p>

    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-12 lg:gap-16">
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-5 text-surface-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
        <p>
          I'm an <strong class="text-white font-semibold">AI Automation Specialist</strong> specializing in building
          end-to-end intelligent systems that eliminate manual work and scale business operations. I design and deploy
          workflows using <strong class="text-white font-semibold">n8n, OpenAI, and API integrations</strong> — from
          AI invoice processing and voice agents to lead pipelines and CRM automation.
        </p>
        <p>
          My work spans the full automation lifecycle: ingesting data from emails, webhooks, and third-party platforms,
          applying AI for classification and decision-making, and syncing outputs into tools like
          <strong class="text-white font-semibold">Supabase, QuickBooks, GoHighLevel, and Slack</strong>. I've replaced
          entire VA team with automation and helped businesses achieve 24/7 operational continuity.
        </p>
        <p>
          I hold a <strong class="text-white font-semibold">BS in Computer Science (Cum Laude)</strong> from Mindanao
          State University, where I was awarded Best in Thesis and Programmer
          of the Year. I've also taught programming, data structures, and
          databases as a Computer Science Instructor.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-4">
        {
          highlights.map((item) => (
            <div class="glass-card p-6 text-center">
              <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-accent-400 mb-1 tracking-tight">
                {item.value}
              </div>
              <div class="text-sm text-surface-400">{item.label}</div>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
